  "body_html": "<h1>Mixed Strategy</h1>\n<p>A mixed strategy for player $i$ is a probability distribution over the strategy\nset $S_i$. When $S_i$ is finite, a mixed strategy is a vector\n$x_i \\in \\Delta(S_i)$ in the standard simplex.</p>",
